- **Health is `/health`**, not `/api/health`. Every generated healthcheck
  points at it.
- **`.feather-templates`** is a symlink to the installed Feather package's
  templates so Tailwind can scan framework components. `feather dev` and
  `feather build` refresh it; the image COPYs the real directory in. Never
  put an absolute path in `static/css/app.css`.
- **Commit `package-lock.json`** so the image build uses `npm ci`.
- `feather docker init` regenerates any of these files (`--force` to
  overwrite).